abstract: >-
  A comprehensive Python library of soft and fuzzy clustering algorithms,
  providing membership-based, possibilistic, evidential, graph, document and
  deep clustering models behind one estimator protocol, together with a
  benchmarking suite for evaluating them on equal terms.
